      "description": "## 🔄 Get Business Details – Login ID Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2a | \\[Option 1\\] Get Business Details - Login ID | Retrieve business details using the business user's login ID. |\n| 2b | \\[Option 2\\] Get Business Details - Login ID with Users | Retrieve business details and associated user information using the business user's login ID. |\n| 2c | \\[Option 3\\] Get Business Details - Login ID with TINs | Retrieve business details and associated TIN information using the business user's login ID. |\n| 2d | \\[Option 4\\] Get Business Details - Login ID with Users and TINs | Retrieve business details, associated user information, and TIN information using the business user's login ID. |",
